<div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-4" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="2000" data-aos-delay="500">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-2">
      <div class="p-2 rounded-full bg-orange-100 border-2 border-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center">
        <%= heroicon "tag", variant: :outline, options: { class: "w-6 h-6 text-orange-500" } %>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">
        期限間近な食材をひと目で把握
      </h3>
    </div>
    <video autoplay loop muted playsinline width="220" class="mx-auto block my-2 rounded-lg shadow ring-1 ring-gray-200">
      <source src="https://i.gyazo.com/e71bfa76fe7dc78d34381cddbfae78c5.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center leading-relaxed">
      登録した食材を期限の近い順に表示。<br>
      期限ラベル（グレー・赤・黄・緑）付きで、期限間近な食材がひと目でわかります。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-4" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="2000" data-aos-delay="500">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-2">
      <div class="p-2 rounded-full bg-pink-100 border-2 border-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center">
        <%= heroicon "heart", variant: :outline, options: { class: "w-6 h-6 text-pink-500" } %>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
        お気に入り登録で時短
      </h3>
    </div>
    <%= image_tag "favorite.png", class: "mx-auto block my-2 rounded-lg shadow ring-1 ring-gray-200 w-72 md:w-80" %>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center">
      よく使う食材をお気に入り登録。<br>
      次回からカテゴリー選択なしでスムーズに登録できます。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-4" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="2000" data-aos-delay="500">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-2">
      <div class="p-2 rounded-full bg-green-100 border-2 border-green-400 flex items-center justify-center">
        <%= heroicon "chart-bar", variant: :outline, options: { class: "w-6 h-6 text-green-500" } %>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">
        食べた／捨てた食材の統計を確認
      </h3>
    </div>
    <%= image_tag "pie_chart.png", class: "mx-auto block my-2 rounded-lg shadow ring-1 ring-gray-200 w-72 md:w-80" %>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center leading-relaxed">
      食べた・捨てた食材を登録すると、<br>
      円グラフや月間ランキングに自動反映。<br>
      よく捨ててしまう食材を把握して、ムダを減らせます。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-4" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="2000" data-aos-delay="500">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-2">
      <div class="p-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-100 border-2 border-yellow-400 flex items-center justify-center">
        <%= heroicon "bell-alert", variant: :outline, options: { class: "w-6 h-6 text-yellow-500" } %>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">
        リマインド通知で使い忘れ防止
      </h3>
    </div>
    <%= image_tag "LINE_message.jpg", class: "mx-auto block my-2 rounded-lg shadow ring-1 ring-gray-200 w-72 md:w-80" %>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center leading-relaxed">
      LINEで期限間近の食材をお知らせ。<br>
      使い忘れを防いで、食材をおいしく使いきれます。
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
